Domain name: NMG.com
●	OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
●	Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users
●	Purpose of each OU: 
Finance
Handles all money-related activities, including budgeting, payroll, accounting, financial reporting, and ensuring the organization uses funds responsibly.
Human Resources (HR)
Manages employee-related functions, including hiring, onboarding, training, performance management, benefits administration, and maintenance of workplace policies.
Information Technology (IT)
Supports and maintains the organization’s technology infrastructure, including networks, servers, computers, cybersecurity, user support, and system administration.
Operations
Oversees the day‑to‑day activities that keep the organization running, ensuring processes, logistics, and services are efficient and aligned with business goals.
